# This proxy image (alpine + haproxy + dnsmasq + iptables + runc +
# quickjs-ng + a small Go seccomp-profile generator — see docker/Dockerfile)
# has a much smaller dependency surface than buildcage/docker's buildkitd-based
# images. Suppressions here should only be added once image-scan.yml has
# actually flagged a finding against this image and the finding has been
# reviewed as inapplicable — no CVE IDs are pre-suppressed by default.
